ow starts at 7:30 p.m. Meet Belinda between 6:45 p.m. and 7 p.m.\n\n**Where:** Lyric Theatre, Meridian Arts Centre, 5040 Yonge Street, North York, ON\n\n**Show Length:** 2 hours, 15 minutes with one intermission\n\n***\n\n**ACCESSIBILITY**\n\nDress Circle is not accessible for wheelchairs or walkers. If you require accessible seating in the Orchestra, please let Belinda know so she can check on availability.\n\n***\n\n**MEETUP ARRANGEMENTS**\n\nMeet Belinda any time between 6:45 p.m. and 7 p.m. inside the first set of doors at the main entrance to the theatre. Belinda will be standing on the left side as you enter. She is very short and will be wearing a bright pink hat and bright pink glasses. Cell # (416) 879-7575 (text/call) for use on the day / time of performance ONLY.\n\n**Intermission Meetup Spot:** TBA\n\n**PLEASE NOTE OUR ZERO-TOLERANCE [CELLPHONE POLICY](https://www.meetup.com/thumbs-up-theatre-toronto/events/243426512/)**","startDate":"2026-10-07T22:45:00.000Z","endDate":"","eventStatus":"https://schema.org/EventScheduled","image":"/images/fallbacks/redesign/group-cover-4-square.webp","eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","location":{"@type":"Place","name":"Meridian Arts Centre","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","addressCountry":"ca","streetAddress":"5040 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 6R8, Canada, Toronto, ON"}},"organizer":{"@type":"Organization","name":"THUMBS UP THEATRE TORONTO - Celebrating 16 Years!","url":"https://www.meetup.com/thumbs-up-theatre-toronto/"},"performer":"THUMBS UP THEATRE TORONTO - Celebrating 16 Years!"},{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Event","name":"Lockpicking Monthly Meetup","url":"https://www.meetup.com/toool_toronto/events/316217317/","description":"Come out to our monthly meetups if you are:\n\n•New to lockpicking and want to learn.\n\n•Experienced with locks and lockpicking and excited to teach and exchange knowledge.\n\nWe have lots of