e":"Wednesday - JOIN WAITLIST -  ESL English X Korean Language Exchange, Class\u0026Games","description":"**\\#\\#\\# ⚠️ If the class is listed as full\\, PLEASE JOIN the waitlist and we will let guests in based on the class’ needs to balance the number of Korean \u0026 English speakers\\!**\n\n**\\#\\#\\# 👨‍🏫** **KOREAN X ENGLISH LANGUAGE EXCHANGE**\n\n* *****************Mini English Class with Certified Teacher + Board Games*** **🎲************\n\n**###** **⚠️ Space is VERY LIMITED** **so register ASAP to save your spot!**\n\n***We can only accept a limited number of guests due to the venue's space limitations.***\n\n**💰** **SPECIAL PROMOTION COST** **🎉:**\n**If this is your first or second TILE. Event, the class is** **FREE, JUST buy 1 item from the Café Princess Menu**\n\n**If you have already attended more than 2 TILE events: pay $5 + buy any menu item from the Café Princess menu**\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n\n**###** **📍 LOCATION: CAFÉ PRINCESS**\n\n* **5590 Yonge Street, North York**\n* **Across the street from** **FINCH SUBWAY STATION**\n**near Shoppers Drug Mart**\n\n**###** ***📅*** **DAY:** ***Every*** ***Wednesday***\n\n* **🕡 Time: 6:30 PM – 8:45 PM** **⏰**\n\n**Please register ASAP** **if you want to attend on Sept 30th so we can save your spot!**\n\n***We had roughly 80 people sign up for the last two events... but we only have space for 30 people max.***\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n**After registering, please do the following on Sept. 30th :**\n\n1. **✅ Do your best to arrive on time @ Café Princess (6:30 PM)**\n1. **✅ Tell us whether you want to focus on learning/practicing ENGLISH or KOREAN**\n1. **✅ Tell us your level: Beginner, Intermediate, Advanced or Expert**\n1. **✅** **Buy 1 item from the Café Princess Menu** **(This is the only cost if this is your 1st or 2nd class. There is an additional $5 fee starting from your third class onwards)**\n\n**\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-**\n**✨ Popular menu items include:**\n\n* ***🍓 Strawberry Cheesecake Bingsu***\n* ***🍧 Mango or Oreo Bingsu***\n* ***☕ Matcha \u0026 Tiramisu Lattes***\n* ***🧇 Princess Waffles with Ice Cream \u0026 Much More***\n\n**###** **What to Expect**\n\n* ***🇰🇷 Guided Korean \u0026 English language practice***\n* ***📚 Interactive mini-lesson led by an award-winning certified teacher***\n* ***🗣️ Structured conversation activities with native and fluent speakers***\n* ***🎲 Board games and social activities to practice language naturally***\n* ***🤝 Make new friends while improving your communication skills***\n\n**👨‍🏫** **MEET YOUR TEACHER \u0026 HOST**\n**###** **Learn From an Expert Language Teacher**\n\n***John Dias (OCT, PhD researcher, MA, BEd, HBA \u0026 EELC) is an award-winning certified language teacher with 10+ years experience***\n\n**###** **Who Should Attend?**\n\n* ***English learners (ESL)***\n* ***Native Korean speakers wanting to practice English***\n* ***Korean learners of all levels***\n* ***International students, newcomers, professionals, and anyone interested in language and culture***\n\n**Feel free to** **📧** **e-mail [info@tilelearning.com](mailto:info@tilelearning.com) if you have any questions.**\n**Check out our** **🌐** **[website](https://www.tilelearning.com/) and [instagram](https://www.instagram.com/tilelearning/) accounts for more details.**","eventType":"PHYSICAL","eventUrl":"https://www.meetup.com/tilesocial/events/316451684/","isSaved":false,"maxTickets":10,"rsvpState":"JOIN_OPEN","featuredEventPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535987318"},"displayPhoto":{"__ref":"PhotoInfo:535987318"},"feeSettings":null,"socialProofInsights":null,"rsvps":{"__typename":"RsvpConnection","totalCount":24,"edges":[{"__typename":"RsvpEdge","node":{"__typename":"Rsvp","isHost":true,"member":{"__ref":"Member:454802190"}}},{"__typename":"RsvpE